      "updated": 1790178527817,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data we are collecting\n\nFOR WAKE TIME\n- Time you logged in at (was it good or bad?)\n- Excuse if it was bad? (via bubble select)\n- New excuse if you have one (is it a valid excuse or invalid?)\n- we want to store ALL WAKE TIMES OVER TIME\n\nFOR RUN\n- How far did you run?\n- How long did it take?\n- We want to store ALL RUNS OVER TIME (distance and time)\n\nFOR TASKS\n- What are your tasks today? (Save all of these)\n- What are your completed tasks? (save these seperately)\n- ",
      "fontSize": 15.1109778477672,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data we are collecting\n\nFOR WAKE TIME\n- Time you logged in at (was it good or bad?)\n- Excuse if it was bad? (via bubble select)\n- New excuse if you have one (is it a valid excuse or invalid?)\n- we want to store ALL WAKE TIMES OVER TIME\n\nFOR RUN\n- How far did you run?\n- How long did it take?\n- We want to store ALL RUNS OVER TIME (distance and time)\n\nFOR TASKS\n- What are your tasks today? (Save all of these)\n- What are your completed tasks? (save these seperately)\n- ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BLnjpjhZKpyjBAVsWIdbt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -296.26734754774316,
      "y": 45.78119744194886,
      "width": 513.5797119140625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
