      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790178530485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal\n\nBuild a morning routine app. Features\n\n- Check and log my 'wake time'\n- Record my run I do in the mornings\n- Ensure that I have some kind of plan for each day\n- Track data for how I'm doing on my runs, streaks\n     on wake time and runs, average pace, best times\n      etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Goal\n\nBuild a morning routine app. Features\n\n- Check and log my 'wake time'\n- Record my run I do in the mornings\n- Ensure that I have some kind of plan for each day\n- Track data for how I'm doing on my runs, streaks\n     on wake time and runs, average pace, best times\n      etc.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ug-ZtdH2GsNFj-VVrrb52",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1306.2384643554683,
      "y": 40.836161295572936,
