      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790178475245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How are we storing/retrieving that data\n\nDATED JSON FILE (1/day)\nStores the following\n- Run distance\n- Run Time\n- Date\n- Clock in time\n- Clock in excuse?\n- Completed Tasks\n\nEXCUSES\n- List of excuses (options) stored on seperate JSON file (1)\n\nTASK LIST\n- Active task list also stored on 1 file\n\nRETRIEVING DATA\n- Data to be stored on Google drive and read from that location.\n- Each PC will be routed to that folder.\n- ALL DATA STORED ON GOOGLE DRIVE\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How are we storing/retrieving that data\n\nDATED JSON FILE (1/day)\nStores the following\n- Run distance\n- Run Time\n- Date\n- Clock in time\n- Clock in excuse?\n- Completed Tasks\n\nEXCUSES\n- List of excuses (options) stored on seperate JSON file (1)\n\nTASK LIST\n- Active task list also stored on 1 file\n\nRETRIEVING DATA\n- Data to be stored on Google drive and read from that location.\n- Each PC will be routed to that folder.\n- ALL DATA STORED ON GOOGLE DRIVE\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KD8x9Dq-SHZ0FLACdUtJO",
