      "updated": 1790178554961,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How does that Data Change?\n\n- Most Data will be static (the daily folders will not change)\n- Todays file will be changing all past static\n- All data outside of that folder will be fluid\n- Deleting and adding for the excuse list\n- Completing or removing items on the task list\n- Adding items to the task list",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How does that Data Change?\n\n- Most Data will be static (the daily folders will not change)\n- Todays file will be changing all past static\n- All data outside of that folder will be fluid\n- Deleting and adding for the excuse list\n- Completing or removing items on the task list\n- Adding items to the task list",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QCLBEZazC8z4JCvUOXZK-",
