      "updated": 1790178479378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How are we presenting that Data?\n\n- All presentation done via TK\n\nRUNNING\n- Basic data on main screen\n    - Pace of your run today\n    - Best time for that category\n    - Your streak\n- INCLUDE ALL OTHER DATA ON OTHER SCREEN\n    - List of all runs in history\n    - Total miles ran this month\n    - Total miles ran all time\n    - Best time for 1 2 and 3 miles\n    - Average pace for month\n    - Average pace all time\n\nCLOCK IN TIME\n- Basic Data on Main Screen\n    - Time you got in\n    - What was your excuse? was it valid?\n    - Your streak\n\nTASKS FOR DAY\n- Button on bottom screen to open task list\n- TASK LIST\n- Todays date\n- Yesterdays tasks in red (keep or delete?)\n- Total tasks completed\n- Somn like that.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How are we presenting that Data?\n\n- All presentation done via TK\n\nRUNNING\n- Basic data on main screen\n    - Pace of your run today\n    - Best time for that category\n    - Your streak\n- INCLUDE ALL OTHER DATA ON OTHER SCREEN\n    - List of all runs in history\n    - Total miles ran this month\n    - Total miles ran all time\n    - Best time for 1 2 and 3 miles\n    - Average pace for month\n    - Average pace all time\n\nCLOCK IN TIME\n- Basic Data on Main Screen\n    - Time you got in\n    - What was your excuse? was it valid?\n    - Your streak\n\nTASKS FOR DAY\n- Button on bottom screen to open task list\n- TASK LIST\n- Todays date\n- Yesterdays tasks in red (keep or delete?)\n- Total tasks completed\n- Somn like that.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
